    <briefdescription>
<para>A scoped timer for a plugin operation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Triggers the <computeroutput>&lt;plugin_name&gt;_start_timer</computeroutput> event on construction and the matching <computeroutput>&lt;plugin_name&gt;_stop_timer</computeroutput> event on destruction, so that the timer plugin can measure the duration of the enclosing scope. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
